headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

docs {
  The same invented shipping API the OpenAPI reference beside this one
  describes, written the other way round — as a Bruno collection somebody
  actually ran.

  It exists to show what the `bruno` section type can and cannot say. There are
  requests, folders, headers and bodies here, and there are no response schemas,
  no reusable components and no field descriptions, because a `.bru` file holds
  none of those.
}
